<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#000;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px">
            <img src="https://bigmamasedibles.cc/assets/images/logo.png" height="90" alt="Big Mamas Edibles">
            <h2 style="color:#e21893">Order Cancelled &#8265;&#65039;</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Hello {{checkoutObj.billingObj.firstName}},</p>
      <p>Unfortunately your order <strong>#{{checkoutObj.orderId}}</strong> was cancelled because while making payment 1 or more of the items you ordered went out of stock.</p>
      <p style="color:#15803d;font-weight:bold">&pound;{{creditedAmount}} has been credited to your high rollas balance, use this to order again &#128154;</p>
      {{#if pendingAccount}}
      <p>Register an account using this email address to access your credit.</p>
      {{/if}}
      <p>We're sorry for the inconvenience. Your payment has been received and your credit can be used towards another order.</p>
      <p><a href="https://bigmamasedibles.cc/account/balance" style="color:#e21893;font-weight:bold">View Your Balance</a></p>
      {{> contact-btn}}
</div>
{{> footer}}
